        "body": "Raw data frequently needs preparation before it can be used effectively for machine learning. Data preparation can include: A useful process can look like: → Prepare Features / Labels → Training-Ready Dataset Good model training begins with appropriate data rather than compensating for poor inputs with increasingly complex models.",
