        "body": "Model optimisation focuses on improving how a trained model performs within its intended operating environment. Optimisation objectives can include: These objectives can compete with one another. → lower memory use → potentially faster inference but may also create: → possible performance trade-offs Optimisation should therefore be driven by measurable production requirements.",
