        "body": "Most iOS apps need a reliable backend system. This backend manages users, data, payments, bookings, notifications, content, reports, admin controls, and integrations. We can connect your iOS app with: Good backend and API integration helps your iOS app work as part of your complete digital system instead of becoming a separate tool.",
