        "body": "APIs connect the Jamstack frontend with content, data and business functionality. Integrations can involve: A project might therefore operate as: CMS \\+ CRM \\+ Ecommerce \\+ Business Systems This allows each system to perform its specialised role without forcing everything into one application.",
