        "heading": "What Is Natural Language Processing?",
        "body": "Natural Language Processing, or NLP, is an area of artificial intelligence that enables software to process and analyse human language. NLP can transform unstructured language into information that software can search, classify, extract, compare or use within automated workflows. A typical NLP workflow can look like: Text / Document → Text Preparation → NLP Model → Classification / Entity / Meaning / Relationship → Structured Output → Business Application NLP can be used with emails, documents, reviews, support conversations, knowledge bases and other text-heavy data sources.",
