        "question": "How long does NLP development take?",
        "answer": "The timeline depends on data readiness, NLP task complexity, training or fine-tuning requirements, model evaluation, software integration and deployment scope. Turn documents, messages and other unstructured language data into software capabilities that can classify, extract, search and support business workflows. Clickmasters can help define the NLP use case, prepare the data, develop or adapt the required language model, integrate it into your application and prepare the solution for production."
